urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:15.41.comment|οτ θηλυκῶς τὴν Ἴλιον
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:15.42.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:15.42.comment|ὁ σύνδ αντ τοῦ εἴθε διοπερ οὐδὲ ὑποστιγμήν ⁑
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:15.43.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:15.43.comment|ϊκετειαν :
