urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:15.46.comment|Ζηνοδ χωρὶς τοῦ ϊ άχνη ⁑
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:15.47.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:15.47.comment|ὁ και αντ η ,
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:15.48.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:15.48.comment|Εὐρυσθὴος αέθλων ⁑
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:15.49.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:15.49.comment|οτ ἀνδρομήκεις αἱ ασπίδες ⁑
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:15.50.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:15.50.comment|γράφεται πρώτων καὶ προτέρων καὶ πρωτέων ,
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:15.51.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:15.51.comment|αναστρεπτεον τὴν προθεσιν ⁑
