urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:16.218r1.comment|τρίτη ἀπο τελους ἡ οξεῖα κύριον γὰρ ⁑
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:16.218v1.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:16.218v1.comment|ἔν τισιν ορωρεν
