urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:17.27.comment|ἐκκέκαυτ
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:17.28.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:17.28.comment|καὶ ὅτι νῦν ἅπαξ καὶ ἐπ λίγδην ἄκρον δὲ ⁑⁑
