urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:17.37.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:17.37.comment|οὐκ Αχιλλεὶ μόνω ⁑⁑
