urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:18.5.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:18.5.comment|τοῦτ δια μεσου τὸ γὰρ ἑξῆς χειρας εχ Αχ : δείδιε γὰρ ⁑
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:18.6.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:18.6.comment|αντ τοῦ εἴδητε
