urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:18.13.comment|ἐν αλλ οὐδ' ἀρα
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:18.14.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:18.14.comment|τῶν τοις Τρωσὶ συμμαχούντων ⁑
