urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:18.32.comment|ἐρυθρὰν ποιῆσαι τῷ αἵματ ⁚
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:18.33.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.diplomatic:18.33.comment|ουτ ᾔδεεν γράφεται δὲ καὶ ῄδειν ⁚
