urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAim.hmt.diplomatic:1.1450.comment|προς τὸ αὐτό
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAim.hmt.diplomatic:1.1451.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAim.hmt.diplomatic:1.1451.comment|λείπει τὸ δύναται
