urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAim.hmt.diplomatic:4.800.comment|οτ απο τῆς Τρωϊκης Λυκίας εξ' εστ ὁ Πάνδαρος ⁑
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAim.hmt.diplomatic:4.803.lemma|
