urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAim.hmt.diplomatic:7.2014.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAim.hmt.diplomatic:7.2014.comment|ἐν άλλω οὗτοι γαρ :
