urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.normalized:20.3_2.comment|μεγαλωφελος
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.normalized:20.3_3.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.normalized:20.3_3.comment|ἕρρώνυντος αἱ ασθινεῖς ⁑
