urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.normalized:20.269r_3.comment|Ἀρίσταρχος ἐνέπρησεν ⁑
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.normalized:20.269v_1.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.normalized:20.269v_1.comment|οὕτως Πείρεω ὡς ἀπὸ ευθείας τῆς Πειρέως
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.normalized:21.271r_7.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.normalized:21.271r_7.comment|εἰς τὸ πέρας πεπραμενος ⁑
