urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.normalized:21.272r_15.comment|οὕτως δια τοῦ καὶ ν ὠτειλην ἅπασαι ⁑
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.normalized:21.272v_12.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAint.hmt.normalized:21.272v_12.comment|ὅτι ἀντὶ τοῦ ὃς φάγοι aν ⁑
