urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAil.hmt.normalized:24.1.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAil.hmt.normalized:24.1.comment|κατεχέατο
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAil.hmt.normalized:24.2.lemma|
urn:cts:greekLit:tlg5026.msAil.hmt.normalized:24.2.comment|πολλῆς θέας άξια κόσμια ⁑
